# ABP Data Seeding

## Creating a Data Seeder
```csharp
public class MyDataSeedContributor : IDataSeedContributor, ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IRepository<Book, Guid> _bookRepository;
    private readonly IGuidGenerator _guidGenerator;

    public async Task SeedAsync(DataSeedContext context)
    {
        if (await _bookRepository.GetCountAsync() > 0)
        {
            return;
        }

        await _bookRepository.InsertAsync(
            new Book(_guidGenerator.Create(), "Sample Book")
        );
    }
}
```

## Running Data Seeder
```csharp
await _dataSeeder.SeedAsync();
```

## Seeding with Tenant Context
```csharp
await _dataSeeder.SeedAsync(new DataSeedContext(tenantId));
```
